# Login Request
# Opcode: 0x6102
# Format: locale (byte) + username (ushort len + utf-8) + password (ushort len + utf-8) + agentId (ushort LE)
# vSRO locale is typically 22 (0x16), not 0.
# Example body below omits agent tail; see GatewayLoginRequestPacketTest (sokybot-proxy) for full layout.
# local: 0x00
# username: "testuser" (8 bytes)
# password: "testpass123" (11 bytes)
00
08 00
74 65 73 74 75 73 65 72
0B 00
74 65 73 74 70 61 73 73 31 32 33
